{"4690030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Weaper", "steam_appid": 4690030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/d22efdbeaae3da65d5b72b2a24d85e0b.avif?t=1787253819\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras_big/d22efdbeaae3da65d5b72b2a24d85e0b.webp?t=1787253819 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>STORYLINE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, the nine year-old, and all of your friends from school, venture out into the woods on Halloween night on a quest to rid the monsters that have infested your town. You and your team quickly realize that this quest is not for the faint-hearted, and therefore, you are all terrified. To make matters worse, your mom only has room for one of you in her car back to town. You must fight against your team and the creatures that lay hidden in order to survive Halloween - and make it back before bedtime. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game of social paranoia, terrifying creatures, and make-believe guns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FEATURES:</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic team creation and destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Event system spawning monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump scare locations that affect your &quot;sanity meter&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle-royale style gameplay with large open map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple fun, Halloween-style locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Execution/finisher kills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FIND A FRIEND</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to one other player throughout the match to increase your chances of survival. But be careful - once there are only a few remaining, the teams will dissolve, and every kid will be on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/1ce2a7b75fdd0fa32eaf1b726d691455.poster.avif?t=1787253819\" width=558 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/1ce2a7b75fdd0fa32eaf1b726d691455.webm?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/1ce2a7b75fdd0fa32eaf1b726d691455.mp4?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>WATCH YOUR SANITY</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will undoubtably encounter monsters, scares, and the shrinking zone, all of which will cause you to slip father and farther into insanity. Watch your (and your teammate's!) sanity meter to ensure you don't go mad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/e5a4ccedd24fdcf4e184daba5c8ed07e.poster.avif?t=1787253819\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/e5a4ccedd24fdcf4e184daba5c8ed07e.webm?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/e5a4ccedd24fdcf4e184daba5c8ed07e.mp4?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FIGHT HALLOWEEN'S CREATURES</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the match, you must fight off zombies, skeletons, ghouls, and even the &quot;Gwim Weaper&quot; himself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/bdfbdda1b13da52710465f49c64ceadf.poster.avif?t=1787253819\" width=486 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/bdfbdda1b13da52710465f49c64ceadf.webm?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/bdfbdda1b13da52710465f49c64ceadf.mp4?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>LEVEL UP</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earning XP throughout the match will help you level up, which gives you Gourds to spend on skins, emotes, finishers, and other fun things to show off to your jealous friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/a33b97b24fee369689f4654beaa8996e.poster.avif?t=1787253819\" width=596 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/a33b97b24fee369689f4654beaa8996e.webm?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/a33b97b24fee369689f4654beaa8996e.mp4?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FIGHT!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your imaginary weapons to fight off the monsters as well as other kids. Watch out for the chaotic Hauntings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/e3bbe5ba5c33e135c7e1ad024874821b.poster.avif?t=1787253819\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/e3bbe5ba5c33e135c7e1ad024874821b.webm?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/e3bbe5ba5c33e135c7e1ad024874821b.mp4?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>SURVIVE HALLOWEEN</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all goes wrong, there's only one spot left in the car home. Be the last kid standing to make it back to the fort.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/d22efdbeaae3da65d5b72b2a24d85e0b.avif?t=1787253819\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras_big/d22efdbeaae3da65d5b72b2a24d85e0b.webp?t=1787253819 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>STORYLINE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, the nine year-old, and all of your friends from school, venture out into the woods on Halloween night on a quest to rid the monsters that have infested your town. You and your team quickly realize that this quest is not for the faint-hearted, and therefore, you are all terrified. To make matters worse, your mom only has room for one of you in her car back to town. You must fight against your team and the creatures that lay hidden in order to survive Halloween - and make it back before bedtime. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game of social paranoia, terrifying creatures, and make-believe guns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FEATURES:</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic team creation and destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Event system spawning monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump scare locations that affect your &quot;sanity meter&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle-royale style gameplay with large open map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple fun, Halloween-style locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Execution/finisher kills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FIND A FRIEND</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to one other player throughout the match to increase your chances of survival. But be careful - once there are only a few remaining, the teams will dissolve, and every kid will be on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/1ce2a7b75fdd0fa32eaf1b726d691455.poster.avif?t=1787253819\" width=558 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/1ce2a7b75fdd0fa32eaf1b726d691455.webm?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/1ce2a7b75fdd0fa32eaf1b726d691455.mp4?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>WATCH YOUR SANITY</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will undoubtably encounter monsters, scares, and the shrinking zone, all of which will cause you to slip father and farther into insanity. Watch your (and your teammate's!) sanity meter to ensure you don't go mad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/e5a4ccedd24fdcf4e184daba5c8ed07e.poster.avif?t=1787253819\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/e5a4ccedd24fdcf4e184daba5c8ed07e.webm?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/e5a4ccedd24fdcf4e184daba5c8ed07e.mp4?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FIGHT HALLOWEEN'S CREATURES</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the match, you must fight off zombies, skeletons, ghouls, and even the &quot;Gwim Weaper&quot; himself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/bdfbdda1b13da52710465f49c64ceadf.poster.avif?t=1787253819\" width=486 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/bdfbdda1b13da52710465f49c64ceadf.webm?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/bdfbdda1b13da52710465f49c64ceadf.mp4?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>LEVEL UP</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earning XP throughout the match will help you level up, which gives you Gourds to spend on skins, emotes, finishers, and other fun things to show off to your jealous friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/a33b97b24fee369689f4654beaa8996e.poster.avif?t=1787253819\" width=596 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/a33b97b24fee369689f4654beaa8996e.webm?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/a33b97b24fee369689f4654beaa8996e.mp4?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FIGHT!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your imaginary weapons to fight off the monsters as well as other kids. Watch out for the chaotic Hauntings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/e3bbe5ba5c33e135c7e1ad024874821b.poster.avif?t=1787253819\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/e3bbe5ba5c33e135c7e1ad024874821b.webm?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/extras/e3bbe5ba5c33e135c7e1ad024874821b.mp4?t=1787253819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>SURVIVE HALLOWEEN</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all goes wrong, there's only one spot left in the car home. Be the last kid standing to make it back to the fort.</p>", "short_description": "Be the last standing against Halloween's monsters and each other in this social spooky shooter game. Team up with others or go solo as you brave the woods, haunted house, and other creepy locations perfect for having fun, getting scared, and shooting at friends.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/28726a9dc3c3e1a8aa2bf79bca5af987cc8c6a59/header.jpg?t=1787253819", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/170cb9edc55982ad2e59314e266bc471faa55008/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787253819", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/170cb9edc55982ad2e59314e266bc471faa55008/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787253819", "website": "https://www.weapergame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 7 5800<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Separate Graphics Card<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Don't worry, I made this thing on an HP laptop I got for school</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Something beefy<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The more expensive the better</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["BoldStudios"], "publishers": ["BoldStudios"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 36, "description": "Online PvP"}, {"id": 35, "description": "In-App Purchases"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4690030/3b7b66f59f75a30dde0dfec2a435bc5a768e54db/ss_3b7b66f59f75a30dde0dfec2a435bc5a768e54db.600x338.jpg?t=1787253819", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/46